# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Roua Trading (رؤى) — Environment Configuration
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ── Database ──
# Local dev (SQLite):
DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"
# Docker / Production (PostgreSQL + pgvector):
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres:roua_dev_2026@postgres:5432/roua_trading"
DB_PASSWORD=roua_dev_2026

# ── Redis ──
REDIS_URL=redis://:roua_redis_2026@localhost:6379
REDIS_PASSWORD=roua_redis_2026

# ── RabbitMQ ──
RABBITMQ_URL=amqp://roua:roua_mq_2026@localhost:5672
RABBITMQ_USER=roua
RABBITMQ_PASSWORD=roua_mq_2026

# ── Encryption (AES-256-GCM for API keys) ──
# Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
ENCRYPTION_KEY=

# ── AI API Keys (Fill in your keys) ──
GOOGLE_AI_STUDIO_API_KEY=     # Gemini 2.0 Flash
GROQ_API_KEY=                 # Llama 3.3 70B via Groq
GLM_API_KEY=                  # GLM-4 via Zhipu AI
HUGGINGFACE_API_KEY=          # Mistral-7B + Phi-3 + Llama-3 (FREE!)
OLLAMA_API_KEY=               # Self-hosted models (Qwen2.5, Llama3, Mistral) — مجاني
OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434  # Ollama server URL
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=            # AWS Bedrock (Claude 3.5, Llama 3.1, Mistral, Titan)
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
AWS_REGION=us-east-1

# ── Market Data ──
TWELVE_DATA_API_KEY=
FINNHUB_API_KEY=

# ── CMS ──
STRAPI_URL=
STRAPI_API_KEY=

# ── WebAuthn (Passkeys) ──
# RP_ID must match your domain (no protocol, no port)
# e.g. for https://roua.up.railway.app → RP_ID=roua.up.railway.app
RP_ID=localhost
RP_NAME=Roua Trading
ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000
# Legacy support (optional):
# WEBAUTHN_RP_ID=localhost

# ── Application ──
NEXTAUTH_SECRET=roua-dev-secret-change-in-production
NEXTAUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000

# ── Google OAuth ──
# Create credentials at: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# Add authorized redirect URI: https://your-domain/api/auth/callback/google
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=

# ── Docker Build (optional) ──
# API_INTERNAL_URL is used during Next.js build for server-side rewrites.
# Defaults to http://localhost:3001 for local dev.
# For Docker Compose, set to http://api:3001 (Docker network hostname).
# API_INTERNAL_URL=http://api:3001
